WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.333
After shipping, decide what you will keep, revise, or stop.

00:00:04.333 --> 00:00:10.167
For the booking rate, divide completed bookings by eligible mobile visits over comparable time windows.

00:00:10.167 --> 00:00:15.667
Check whether traffic mix, holidays, or tracking changes could explain what you see.

00:00:15.667 --> 00:00:20.750
Log your decision and evidence. Turn the next open question into a new test.
